# Testing

Orchestration (when A vs B, phase commits): `docs/agent-loop.md`.

After substantive code changes, run and **read** `pnpm check:fast` (A; no stryker). Full e2e / `pnpm verify` only when CI needs them or an explicit full-suite request. Flake proof = CI burn-in; local `--repeat-each=3` only after a local fail-then-pass. Playwright gates every PR in CI.

Out-of-scope failures: `docs/roadmap/RULES.md`. Test authorship: skill `write-tests` (artifact mandates in `openspec/config.yaml`).
